# v37 OVERLAY (user 2026-11-03, after the throttle dead zone was measured):
# v30's REWARD, the user's 200 m goal chaining, and the throttle floor.
#
# WHY THIS COMBINATION.
# 1. v30's reward is the only recipe in this lineage that demonstrably reads
#    the goal image: Town02 0.560 true against 0.030 with another episode's
#    image. Everything since has been goal-blind -- v35 (route progress only
#    inside junction zones) 0.000/0.025, v36 (repo lane reward, goal only in
#    the arrival bonus) 0.375/0.300 once its stalls were removed. So the dense
#    route-progress term with a partial retreat charge comes back unchanged.
# 2. The chaining the user asked for (slurm/v35_overlay.env) is kept: a new
#    goal past the next junction on each arrival, until 200 m is driven.
# 3. MIN_THROTTLE closes the measured dead zone (scripts/throttle_probe.py:
#    throttle <= 0.13 drives 0.00 m, 0.14 drives). Re-running v36 step_600000
#    with it took that checkpoint from 0.175 to 0.375 on the same 40 episodes,
#    paired p = 0.0078, with stalls 30 -> 1.
#
# NOT INHERITED FROM v35/v36: EXPLORE_PROB. Those two ran goal-mode-only and
# both failed; v30's 50/50 mix is part of what is being reproduced, so the
# sbatch default (0.5) stands. A chain continuation is forced to stay a GOAL
# episode (gated_reward.reset), or half of them would land in the explore arm.
. "$REPO/slurm/v30_overlay.env"

# -- the user's chaining (v35), without v35's zone gating of the reward.
export GOAL_CHAIN_M=200 GOAL_CHAIN_MIN_M=10 GOAL_CHAIN_MAX_M=30 GOAL_CHAIN_LOOKAHEAD_M=60
# The env must not move the goal on a too-fast pass: the goal image is latched
# at reset, so a resample there leaves the planner and the image disagreeing.
export GOAL_KEEP_ON_PASS=1
# A chain can now pay several legs of route progress plus several arrivals.
export TQC_VALUE_CEILING=300

# -- the throttle dead zone (0.14 is the measured edge; 0.15 leaves margin).
export MIN_THROTTLE=0.15
# Safety net: 100 steps (5 s) under 0.5 km/h truncates rather than burning the
# whole clock. With the floor this should essentially never fire.
export STALL_TRUNCATE_STEPS=100 STALL_SPEED_KMH=0.5

# -- v30's launch settings, which v30 passed on the command line (v35's first
# launch silently lost them): HER, a 1M-row uint8 replay on the CPU, 15%
# noise-free episodes, a video every 20th.
export HER=1 REPLAY_CAPACITY=1000000 REPLAY_DEVICE=cpu REPLAY_U8=1
export DET_EPISODE_FRAC=0.15 VIDEO_EVERY=20
